<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2015/06/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>localpass</id>
    <version>0.0.0</version>
    <packageSourceUrl>https://github.com/xieboss778/LocalPass/tree/main/apps/desktop/stores/chocolatey</packageSourceUrl>
    <owners>kspearrin</owners>
    <title>LocalPass</title>
    <authors>LocalPass contributors</authors>
    <projectUrl>https://github.com/xieboss778/LocalPass</projectUrl>
    <iconUrl>https://github.com/xieboss778/LocalPass/raw/main/apps/desktop/resources/icon.ico</iconUrl>
    <copyright>Copyright © 2026 LocalPass contributors</copyright>
    <projectSourceUrl>https://github.com/xieboss778/LocalPass/</projectSourceUrl>
    <docsUrl>https://github.com/xieboss778/LocalPass#readme</docsUrl>
    <bugTrackerUrl>https://github.com/xieboss778/LocalPass/issues</bugTrackerUrl>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/xieboss778/LocalPass/releases</releaseNotes>
    <licenseUrl>https://github.com/xieboss778/LocalPass/blob/master/LICENSE.txt</licenseUrl>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <tags>localpass password manager offline</tags>
    <summary>A secure and free password manager for all of your devices.</summary>
    <description>
      LocalPass 是一个完全离线的密码管理器。

      数据只存在你自己的电脑上：没有注册、没有云端同步、没有厂商服务器。保险库在本地用
      AES-256 加密后写入磁盘，主密码与解锁密钥永不离开设备。

      内置密码生成器、动态口令（TOTP）、Passkey 与自动填充；可选把密文备份到你自己的
      S3 兼容存储。

      许可证：GPL-3.0。源代码：https://github.com/xieboss778/LocalPass
    </description>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
